subsequently fixed in \rivet version~3\cite{Bierlich:2019rhm}. This fixed version was used to make these updated plots}.
Although the $\ZP$ is well below the mass window of the $Z$ or even $Z^*$ in the measurement, combinatorials still populate the fiducial region.
Given all of this, one can expect this region to be addressed by future LHC measurements, with increased luminosity and beam energy.


